  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>'</mo><mo>'</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>'</mo><mo>'</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>'</mo><mo>'</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>On integrating both side, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">cf</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Again integrating, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
